# The images publish.yml publishes, one per line (release/README.md):
#   <image> <build context> <shared context, or -> <Compose service, or ->
# Each is published as ghcr.io/<owner>/lollo-<image>, named by its content
# tag (release/content-tag), and lolloctl names it by RELEASE's
# LOLLO_IMAGE_<IMAGE> (release_key). Not here, built on the host instead:
# doc-tools (AGPL-3.0 PyMuPDF) and code-server/exec (FROM the app-server's image).
landing            landing            lollo-common  landing
vault               vault               lollo-common  lollo-vault
gmail-triggers      gmail-triggers      lollo-common  lollo-gmail-triggers
news-radar          news-radar          lollo-common  lollo-news-radar
pipelock            pipelock            -              lollo-pipelock
code-server         code-server         lollo-common  lollo-code-server
code-server-editor  code-server/editor  -              lollo-code-server-editor
backup              backup              -              -
